description:
Designed specifically for triathlon, swimming, cycling, and running, this bag features high-capacity, compartmentalized storage capable of holding a full set of gear—including swimwear, cycling apparel, running shoes, a helmet, protective gear, accessories, and a change of clothes—to meet the needs of training and race-day travel. A separate bottom compartment allows for the isolated storage of wet clothing or swimwear; this wet/dry separation design keeps the interior dry and prevents damp items from contaminating dry gear.
- Front pockets with multiple zippers provide convenient access to small essentials like a phone, keys, energy gels, a timer, and tools;
- Expandable mesh side pockets accommodate water cups, bottles, and goggles;
- A wide-opening top main compartment allows for easy packing of bulky clothing;
With multiple compartments for organized storage and quick access, the bag is perfectly suited for the rapid transitions required during races.
